+<p>This is design arithmetic, not a survey of Dutch prices. Every price, conversion and cost below is a validation hurdle. The model deliberately keeps batteries, meters, gateways, electrical works and installation off this company's revenue and warranty line. Baselines carry no installer discount. Production onboarding and recurring service carry a 25% installer discount, so the table records 75% net wholesale receipts rather than retail billings.</p>
