+<tr><td><strong>Retained surplus before tax</strong></td><td><strong>−89.25</strong></td><td><strong>191.5</strong></td></tr>
+<tr><td>Working-capital reserve: two months of delivery, operating and founder-replacement costs</td><td>(55 + 43 + 85) × 2/12 = 30.5</td><td>(245 + 100 + 110) × 2/12 = 75.8</td></tr>
